MintCurveConvexPosition::borrowAndDepositToLp(uint256,uint256)
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
    ├── when borrowAssets is zero
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    └── when borrowAssets is greater than zero
        ├── given the borrow exceeds the market max LTV for the position collateral
        │   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketBorrowingTooMuch
        └── given the borrow is within the market max LTV
            ├── given DUSD is coin0 of the Curve pool
            │   └── it should supply DUSD one-sided at index 0
            ├── given DUSD is coin1 of the Curve pool
            │   └── it should supply DUSD one-sided at index 1
            ├── when the minted Curve LP is less than minLpOut
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when the minted Curve LP is at least minLpOut
                ├── it should borrow borrowAssets of DUSD from the mint market to the position
                ├── it should add borrowAssets of DUSD one-sided to the Curve pool
                ├── it should stake the received Curve LP into Convex
                ├── it should reset the Curve and Convex allowances to zero
                └── it should emit Deposited
